    "sourceUrl" : "",
    "body" : "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1730370034993\" id=\"item-672351b2bc782910bbf411ef\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-5307de4ecfeb7d5b555b\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>About us: </strong>PropertyMedia Japan specializes in Real Estate Photography, Videography, Aerial Photography, Floorplans, and Virtual Staging. Previously based in Queenstown New Zealand, we are now operating in Niseko, Hokkaido Japan </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Discover the perfect blend of comfort and modern elegance at this beautifully crafted home, situated in one of Auckland\u2019s most serene neighborhoods.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bedrooms:</strong> Four spacious, well-lit bedrooms, each designed for optimal comfort and relaxation. These cozy retreats feature high-quality finishes and thoughtful details, ensuring a restful atmosphere for everyone.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bathrooms:</strong> Two sleek, modern bathrooms with high-end fixtures and a clean, minimalist design. Both spaces evoke a spa-like ambiance, ideal for unwinding after a long day.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Living Rooms:</strong> Two expansive living areas that serve as the heart of the home, perfect for entertaining and family gatherings. Large windows allow natural light to pour in, offering beautiful views of the surrounding landscape.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Kitchen:</strong> A contemporary, fully equipped kitchen featuring top-of-the-line appliances and ample cabinetry. Its open layout makes cooking and hosting a joy, whether you're preparing a weeknight dinner or a holiday feast.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Garage:</strong> A convenient single-car garage provides secure parking and extra storage space, ensuring your vehicle is protected from the elements and your belongings are organized.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Outdoor Living:</strong> Enjoy the tranquil outdoors with a landscaped garden and a stylish patio area, perfect for alfresco dining or a relaxing morning coffee surrounded by nature.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Constructed with quality and sustainability in mind, this home at 6 Old Mill Rd offers a unique opportunity to experience the peaceful charm of Auckland while benefiting from modern comforts. This property is ideal for families seeking a cozy retreat or professionals looking for a relaxing escape close to the city. Make this exceptional residence your sanctuary and experience the best of New Zealand living.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block gallery-block sqs-block-gallery\" data-block-json=\"&#123;&quot;existingGallery&quot;:null,&quot;hSize&quot;:null,&quot;newWindow&quot;:false,&quot;floatDir&quot;:null,&quot;methodOption&quot;:&quot;transient&quot;,&quot;aspectRatio&quot;:null,&quot;auto-crop&quot;:true,&quot;blockAnimation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;collectionId&quot;:&quot;672355c18ec1242b8540c4e2&quot;,&quot;design&quot;:&quot;stacked&quot;,&quot;show-meta&quot;:true,&quot;show-meta-basic&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-title&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-description&quot;:false,&quot;square-thumbs&quot;:true,&quot;vSize&quot;:null,&quot;transientGalleryId&quot;:&quot;672355c18ec1242b8540c4e2&quot;&#125;\" data-block-type=\"8\" data-sqsp-block=\"gallery\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1730258888192_915404\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n<div class=\"\n  sqs-gallery-container\n  sqs-gallery-block-stacked\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n  \n\n  \n  block-animation-none\n  clear\"\n  \n  \n>\n  <div class=\"sqs-gallery\">\n    \n      \n        \n          <div class=\"image-wrapper\" id=\"672355cb88da2864d72110f2\" data-type=\"image\" data-animation-role=\"image\">\n            \n              <noscript><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1730368977342-K9Z1MGEGJXNJYHGK38QA/6+Old+Mill+Rd%2C+Auckland+-++Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Photographer+Videographer+%286%29.jpg\" alt=\"6 Old Mill Rd, Auckland -  Niseko Kutchan Hokkaido Japan Real Estate Property Agent Photographer Videographer (6).jpg\" /></noscript><img class=\"thumb-image\" elementtiming=\"system-gallery-block-stacked\" data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1730368977342-K9Z1MGEGJXNJYHGK38QA/6+Old+Mill+Rd%2C+Auckland+-++Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Photographer+Videographer+%286%29.jpg\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1730368977342-K9Z1MGEGJXNJYHGK38QA/6+Old+Mill+Rd%2C+Auckland+-++Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Photographer+Videographer+%286%29.jpg\" data-image-dimensions=\"4000x2670\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"6 Old Mill Rd, Auckland -  Niseko Kutchan Hokkaido Japan Real Estate Property Agent Photographer Videographer (6).jpg\" data-load=\"false\" data-image-id=\"672355cb88da2864d72110f2\" data-type=\"image\" />\n            \n          </div>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n      \n        \n          <div class=\"image-wrapper\" id=\"672355d2aa9bb25a10fc131a\" data-type=\"image\" data-animation-role=\"image\">\n            \n              <noscript><img 